                    {
                        "translation_id": "2c10edd2-127a-458c-b696-a3a31feedbc1",
                        "source_entry_id": "d27914b3-da0a-3a58-9fc6-f3f5bf9c592e",
                        "source_sense_id": "a2aaa3b8-bf3e-3f40-927d-17e87ae35df3",
                        "target_lang_word": "insufferable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "insufferable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                        "entry_id": "14096140-fe22-3b85-80e7-72ce82d6113e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not sufferable; very difficult or impossible to endure; intolerable, unbearable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc854b64-ff68-4486-82e5-e04e2e70606b",
                                                "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                                "text": "No, his good Meen, his Youth, and blooming Face / Tempt him to think, that vvith a better grace / Himſelf might ſit, and thou ſupply his place. / Behold there yet remains, vvhich muſt be born, / Proud Servants more inſufferable Scorn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bb79cd6-edfa-4efa-841f-a67b0da384ed",
                                                "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                                "text": "She is sensible that a vain person is the most insufferable creature living in a well-bred assembly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bd73d3a-4570-469d-99b8-5baa2b6b5e85",
                                                "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                                "text": "This is insufferable! My dearest friend, I was never so enraged before, and must relieve myself by writing to you, who I know will enter into all my feelings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "804795ef-d754-49b6-a29d-9c25420a3436",
                                                "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                                "text": "\"She had better have stayed at home,\" cried Elizabeth; \"perhaps she meant well, but, under such a misfortune as this, one cannot see too little of one's neighbours. Assistance is impossible; condolence, insufferable. Let them triumph over us at a distance, and be satisfied.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adf4dbf0-f14b-4209-8e95-241a3d32aaf0",
                                                "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                                "text": "He heard and saw, and sought to free / His strain'd eye from the sight: / But Heaven's high magic bound it there, / Still gazing, though untaught to bear / Th' insufferable light."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ec4e3b7-dca5-41fa-a40a-ce5ba290bbf5",
                                                "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                                "text": "It was of course familiar to me that Saltram was incapable of keeping the engagements which, after their separation, he had entered into with regard to his wife, a deeply wronged, justly resentful, quite irreproachable and insufferable person."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55c9a87c-364b-4ad9-bea7-c979bc117d09",
                                                "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                                "text": "That the illumination should have been kindled by his cousin's husband was not precisely agreeable to Marvell, who thought Peter a bore in society and an insufferable nuisance on closer terms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7fbece4-e255-4df8-8afb-a55737aaf7f0",
                                                "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                                "text": "The oppressive heat has become insufferable in Syria – and as the temperature climbs, emotions get harder to contain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74116d91-b50d-44e8-add2-5aa69707fba3",
                                                "sense_id": "bfba90a4-b54c-3068-8c35-0a03c52ddf7c",
                                                "text": "It became clear to me: guys who like Kafka—it’s never women—are insufferable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
